# Docs & agent setup

- Specs: `docs/superpowers/specs/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md`
- Plans: `docs/superpowers/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature>.md`
- Project skills: `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`
- Official Remotion skills: installed via `npx skills add remotion-dev/skills`
- Prefer Context7 MCP for live Remotion / React docs over stale training data

When adding a new agent skill for this project, put it under `.cursor/skills/` (project-scoped), not `~/.cursor/skills-cursor/`.
